# Visualization & tiles

- Follow root `ARCHITECTURE.md`: four planes (Artifact, Metadata, Tensor Tile, Visualization).
- GLB is not a tensor database — geometry, instances, quantized visual attrs, feature IDs only.
- Tensor payloads belong in `.qtile` (or exact range reads), not duplicated FP16 weights in GLB.
- CesiumJS is tile traversal / LOD / picking for the prototype; not a compute engine.
- Procedural cell positions: tile origin + logical index / Morton decode — do not store absolute XYZ per scalar.
- Results must be labeled exact, sampled, or approximate.
- Prefer `apps/web` Cesium spike and `crates/q-*` over expanding legacy `quatricmorph/` Three.js.
